# The demo image is built from the repository root (demo/Dockerfile needs composer.json, CHANGELOG.md (the footer shows its newest release), src/ and benchmarks/seed.sql).
# Allow-list: everything is ignored unless it is named here.
*
!demo/
!src/
!composer.json
!CHANGELOG.md
!benchmarks/seed.sql

# ...and re-ignore what must never enter the image (installed or generated by the build itself).
**/.git
**/vendor
**/var
**/tests
demo/assets/vendor
demo/public/assets
demo/docker-compose*.yml
demo/README.md
demo/.env.example
demo/docker.env
